{"synopsis":"Oleh Studio yang membawakanmu Surviving The Game as a Barbarian dan The Player Hides His Past dan Heavenly Grand Archives Young Master dan masih banyak lagi\nSelama pandemi besar gym ku mengalami kebangkrutan Saat itu aku berusaha matimatian untuk memenuhi kebutuhan aku masuk ke dalam salah satu akartker murim\nAku senang melihat diriku berada di Kuil Shaolin tapi apaapaan ini Tubuh setiap orang rusak karena cara berolahraga yang salah\nBagaimana aku hanya duduk dan menonton ketika aku seoarang Trainer\nAku akan mengajari mereka metode olahraga modern yang benar dan menyembuhkan semuanya","alternative_title":"천재 무림 트레이너","author":"Keulu Keulu, Koul","artist":"Midnight Studio","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"ddca9e23-0289-4967-9d90-ca3c09914a4f","number":"116","chapter":"116","title":"","date":"2026-06-27","released":"2026-06-27"},{"chapter_id":"15cce0b3-d3ea-4a9b-8fa1-4293ff2fb3fe","number":"115","chapter":"115","title":"","date":"2026-06-27","released":"2026-06-27"},{"chapter_id":"a69e59ef-fdb7-4660-85c6-4af1df3b40be","number":"114","chapter":"114","title":"","date":"2026-06-27","released":"2026-06-27"},{"chapter_id":"f64908ab-5cfc-4284-97b2-204c45121594","number":"113","chapter":"113","title":"","date":"2026-05-20","released":"2026-05-20"},{"chapter_id":"df10d079-3d5b-4132-82f6-4fec481e955a","number":"112","chapter":"112","title":"","date":"2026-05-18","released":"2026-05-18"},{"chapter_id":"79777f20-964b-4e86-bb2e-f5278f94dcdc","number":"111","chapter":"111","title":"","date":"2026-05-18","released":"2026-05-18"},{"chapter_id":"234c14c9-b681-4e7f-8922-02803187c757","number":"110","chapter":"110","title":"","date":"2026-05-18","released":"2026-05-18"},{"chapter_id":"bcd05988-77a4-4ad1-a890-43c60849f251","number":"109","chapter":"109","title":"","date":"2026-05-16","released":"2026-05-16"},{"chapter_id":"e3b7a724-5dce-4abc-8971-303b18ee10c3","number":"108","chapter":"108","title":"","date":"2026-05-01","released":"2026-05-01"},{"chapter_id":"4a8793f4-c0a4-4